{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"جامع الترمذي","section":{"49":"Chapters on Virtues"},"section_detail":{"49":{"hadithnumber_first":3605,"hadithnumber_last":3956,"arabicnumber_first":3605,"arabicnumber_last":3956,"name_native":"فصول في الفضائل"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3776,"arabicnumber":3776,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن يحيى، قال حدثنا عبد الرزاق، عن معمر، عن الزهري، عن انس بن مالك، قال لم يكن احد منهم اشبه برسول الله من الحسن بن علي . هذا حديث حسن صحيح","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari"}],"reference":{"book":49,"hadith":175}}]}